# SIDE JOB - REPO MAN (vehicle theft and police pursuit)
mission 22
key s22
title "Repo Man"
desc "Ace at the pawn shop has a buyer for a muscle car the cops just towed. It's parked right outside the 4th Precinct. Of course it is."
start pawn 0 -7
requires 4
reward 900
side
repeatable

vehicle repo muscle @police 12 -8 90 0.55 0.05 0.04
goto @police 0 -12 10 "Go to the 4th Precinct"
enter_vehicle repo "Steal the impounded muscle car"
wanted 2
music chase
lose_wanted "Lose the police"
music tension
drive_to @chop_shop 0 3 6 "Deliver the car to Varga's Garage"
exit_vehicle "Get out of the car"
music calm
end
